      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## AR LoRA training\n\nPut recordings and reviewed .caption.txt / .lyrics.txt sidecars in ComfyUI/input/my_music, or choose your own audio folder. Empty lyrics mean instrumental.\n\nOptional Gemini: queue the captioner alone, review its text, then mute it before training. Requires GEMINI_API_KEY and sends audio to Google.\n\nTraining Models downloads missing assets when queued. Install requirements-training.txt first. Checkpoint previews render during training; use resume.pt to resume. See docs/TRAINING.md.\n\nUse a new output_name for each new experiment. Select a saved checkpoint with Use to skip training."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
